OL,3,GNEWSAMurder inquiry after stabbed man
OL,4,Adies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died three days after he was
OL,7,Fstabbed in what police said was thought
OL,8,Fto be a targeted attack.
OL,10,FPolice were called to reports of a
OL,11,Fstabbing on Ashville Avenue, Hodge Hill
OL,12,Fin Birmingham, at about 23:50 BST on
OL,13,FTuesday. The man, in his 30s, was taken
OL,14,Fto hospital having suffered a number of
OL,15,Finjuries and but later died.
OL,17,FWest Midlands Police have launched a
OL,18,Fmurder inquiry are carrying out CCTV
OL,19,Fand house-to-house inquiries.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
